      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 \u2014 Ref2VA NSFW + SpeedStack (Native 20 Step Quality)\\n\\nUses **NaughtyTimes v2 NSFW LoRA** with **SpeedStack Acceleration** (FirstBlockCache + SageAttention + Spectrum).\\n\\n### Key Settings\\n- **LoRA**: `minimax_h3_naughty_times_v2.safetensors` (strength 0.5)\\n- **Text Encoder**: `qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors` (Heretic / uncensored)\\n- **SpeedStack**: FirstBlockCache (0.12) + SageAttention + Spectrum (replay=OFF)\\n- **Steps**: 20 steps (Native DiT quality, ~3x faster, NO Turbo LoRA)\\n- **Resolution**: 608x352 (0.2 MP, L4-safe)\\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
