    {
      "id": 212,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1200,
        1440
      ],
      "size": [
        780,
        380
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 42,
      "mode": 0,
      "title": "Guide: Open-H3-Regenerate-2K Refinement (T2V)",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Open-H3-Regenerate-2K Refinement Pipeline (T2V)\n\n### 1. Two-Stage High-Resolution Architecture\n- **Stage 1 (Draft Generation)**: Standard MiniMax H3 generation at 768P. Immediately decodes and saves draft to `video/MiniMax_H3_T2V_768p_Draft`.\n- **Stage 2 (Open-H3-Regenerate-2K Master)**:\n  - Takes clean denoised latent (x0) directly from Stage 1 slot 1.\n  - **Latent Upscaler**: 3D-convolutional neural network (`h3_clean_latent_upscaler_film_epoch200.safetensors`) performs learned 2x spatial super-resolution directly in latent space (2112x1216).\n  - **Refiner LoRA**: `minimax_h3_open_regenerate_2k_refiner_rank_384_bf16.safetensors` (NVlabs Sana / Kijai distilled 2K refiner).\n  - **Noise Schedule**: Exact NVlabs 3-step continuous flow sigmas `[0.909375, 0.857143, 0.666667, 0.0]`.\n  - **Noise Shield**: Uses `DisableNoise` to prevent double-noise static blowout.\n  - Saves 2K Master to `video/MiniMax_H3_T2V_2K_Master`.\n\n### 2. Speed vs Quality Control\n- **Full 3-Step Refiner (Maximum Sharpness)**: Keep ManualSigmas at `0.909375, 0.857143, 0.666667, 0.0`.\n- **1-Step Refiner (3x Faster, ~5 min on 18s clip)**: Change ManualSigmas text to `0.909375, 0.0`. (Step 1 recovers >80% of fine texture).\n- **Direct 2K Latent Upscale (~30 seconds)**: Connect Node 204 (`latent`) directly to Node 208 (`samples`), bypassing Node 207!\n\n### 3. Single-Click Bypass (Draft Only Mode)\nSelect all green Stage 2 nodes and press **Ctrl+M** (Mute). ComfyUI will run ONLY Stage 1 and stop immediately!\n"
      ],
      "color": "#1e3a5f",
      "bgcolor": "#0d1b2a"
    }
